{
  "quest.74A821FFB9A2E24D.title": "Aerial Pearl? In This Economy?",
  "quest.74A821FFB9A2E24D.quest_subtitle": "Craft or obtain Aerial Pearl",
  "quest.74A821FFB9A2E24D.quest_desc": [
    "Aerial Pearl — an item from the Powah mod.",
    "",
    "Powah generates and stores FE for everything else on the island. Start small, dream of nitro cells, pretend you planned the cable route.",
    "",
    "How to make it:",
    "• Craft it in a shaped pattern — open JEI and search the item for the exact grid layout.",
    "",
    "Skyblock tip: your random center block may eventually roll the parts — stash duplicates in storage until you have the full recipe."
  ],
